---
import Tokamak from "../Tokamak.astro";
---

<section>
  <div class="mb-4 sm:mb-7 md:mb-10 lg:mb-15 xl:mb-19">
    <h2
      class="text-heading-5 md:text-heading-4 lg:text-heading-3 xl:text-heading-2 mb-4 sm:mb-7 md:mb-10 lg:mb-15 xl:mb-19"
    >
      About the tokamak
    </h2>
    <p
      class="text-purple font-medium md:text-[20px] lg:text-[24px] xl:text-[28px]"
    >
      What exactly is a tokamak?
    </p>
    <p class="text-body md:text-heading-5 lg:text-heading-4 xl:text-heading-3">
      It’s a fusion device that uses electromagnetic fields to confine
      superheated plasma, replicating the conditions that happens in the Sun.
      And yes—this is the device AtomCraft is building from scratch.
    </p>
  </div>
  <Tokamak />
</section>
